sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Researcher
    participant UI as ChatInterface (Frontend)
    participant API as AssistantEndpoint (/assistant/query)
    participant Ret as EvidenceRetriever
    participant Rerank as ScientificReranker
    participant LLM as LLM Provider (Gemini / Mock)
    participant Cit as CitationValidator
    participant DB as Vector & Document Store

    User->>UI: Submit research inquiry
    UI->>API: POST /assistant/query (query, filter, top_k)
    API->>Ret: Retrieve candidate chunks
    Ret->>DB: Cosine similarity search against query vector
    DB-->>Ret: Top K candidate chunks
    Ret->>Rerank: Candidate chunks with similarity scores
    Rerank->>Rerank: Boost for measurement units & section terms
    Rerank-->>API: Top reranked scientific chunks
    alt Insufficient Evidence (threshold not met)
        API-->>UI: Return abstention response (no ungrounded assertions)
    else Sufficient Verified Evidence
        API->>LLM: Generate response grounded in context chunks
        LLM-->>API: Synthesized scientific answer
        API->>Cit: Build and verify citations (DOI, page, excerpt)
        Cit-->>API: Validated citations list
        API-->>UI: Return answer + verified citations + uncertainty note
        UI-->>User: Display answer with interactive citation cards
    end
